sp("about","About FileMoss","About FileMoss: free, private browser-based tools for office work.","<p>FileMoss is a collection of free tools for everyday office work—PDFs, images, spreadsheets, text, dates and pay. We built it because most “free online converters” upload your documents to unknown servers. FileMoss does the work inside your browser instead, using well-known open-source libraries: <a href='https://pdf-lib.js.org/'>pdf-lib</a>, Mozilla's <a href='https://mozilla.github.io/pdf.js/'>pdf.js</a>, <a href='https://sheetjs.com/'>SheetJS</a>, heic2any and qrcode-generator.</p><h2>Accuracy</h2><p>Calculators show the formula they use, and every tool is covered by automated tests that run before each update. If you find a mistake, please <a href='/contact/'>tell us</a>.</p><h2>Limitations</h2><p>Results are provided as-is. Pay and overtime figures are gross amounts and not legal or tax advice.</p>")
sp("privacy","Privacy Policy","FileMoss privacy policy.",f"<p><i>Last updated: October 29, 2026</i></p><h2>Your files and text</h2><p>All FileMoss tools process files and text locally in your web browser. Files you select, text you paste and numbers you enter are not uploaded to, or stored on, our servers.</p><h2>Hosting and logs</h2><p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages, which may process technical data such as IP addresses for security and performance, as described in Cloudflare's privacy policy.</p><h2>Cookies and advertising</h2><p>We do not currently set cookies. In the future we may show ads (for example via Google AdSense). Third-party vendors, including Google, may then use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visits. You can opt out of personalized advertising at <a href='https://adssettings.google.com'>Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href='https://www.aboutads.info'>aboutads.info</a>. This policy will be updated before any such service is enabled.</p><h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>Some pages may in future contain clearly disclosed affiliate links, at no extra cost to you.</p><h2>Anonymous usage counts</h2><p>To learn which tools are actually used, the site sends a tiny anonymous signal when you use a tool, for example when you press Calculate, choose a file, finish processing or download a result. The signal contains only the tool name, the type of action, the page language, your country as reported by Cloudflare and your browser family (such as Chrome). It never includes your files, text or the values you enter. Actions counted are: Calculate (including the first valid live result on a page), choose a file, finish processing, download and copy. Each count is stored with the date only (no time of day). We set no cookies, use no identifiers and do not store your IP address. To block abuse, the server keeps a salted one-way hash of your IP address and the current minute for at most a few minutes, then deletes it.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this policy: <a href='mailto:{EM}'>{EM}</a>.</p>")
sp("contact","Contact","Contact FileMoss.",f"<p>Found a bug, a wrong result, or want a new tool? We'd love to hear from you.</p><p>Email: <a href='mailto:{EM}'>{EM}</a></p><p>You can also <a href='https://github.com/yamakaru/filemoss/issues'>open an issue on GitHub</a>.</p>")
